; M12: units. main uses Shapes (next to it) and MathUtils (found via -I);
; Shapes itself uses MathUtils. Initialization parts run in dependency order.
; RUN: %p3 --mode=tp -I %S/Inputs/units/lib %S/Inputs/units/main.pas -o %t
; RUN: %t | FileCheck %s
; CHECK:      MathUtils ready
; CHECK-NEXT: Shapes ready
; CHECK-NEXT: square with side 7 has area 49
; CHECK-NEXT: gcd(84, 36) = 12
; CHECK-NEXT: square called 1 times; 2*pi ~ 6.28
